	(gr_text "CURRENT PCB NOTE 1: Circuit revision C5; 0.8 mm / 2-layer / ENIG / single board.\nCURRENT PCB NOTE 2: MCU and IMU INTERNAL ROUTED CUTOUTS intentionally cross PTH centers.\nCURRENT PCB NOTE 3: Do not straighten or alter the outline; contact before any process change/upcharge.\nCURRENT PCB NOTE 4: Prototype may use ordinary routing at internal PTH edges if castellations are unavailable.\nCURRENT PCB NOTE 5: ESP32-S3 EP41 has no host land; assembly must ground perimeter pads 1 and 40.\nCURRENT PCB NOTE 6: JP_ADC_TL/TR/BL/BR are DNP; use the current MX1.25 tail map."
